  "findings_not_to_overstate": [
    "MediQzy provider configuration is not a working call adapter",
    "Chatwoot support and general messaging are partial/reusable, not universally absent",
    "Working-tree text sentiment exists and is not acoustic sentiment or deployment evidence",
    "Existing biometric consent/result storage is not model-backed verification",
    "Peer source presence and README claims are not live acceptance",
    "Comcent CE and Enterprise offerings differ",
    "VoiceAgent default authentication and simple voiceprint need qualification",
    "Astradial workflow entrypoints target different external ticket URLs",
    "Object PHI masking does not redact free-text strings"
  ],
